OL,3,GNEWSADerelict sites warning after
OL,4,Atrespasser posts images
OL,5,
OL,6,FA warning has been issued about the
OL,7,Fdangers of trespassing in buildings
OL,8,Fearmarked for demolition after images
OL,9,Femerged online from inside a condemned
OL,10,Fsite.
OL,12,FA so-called urban explorer posted
OL,13,Fimages on social media standing on top
OL,14,Fof Sovereign House in Norwich, stating
OL,15,Fhe managed it despite being told it was
OL,16,F"impossible".
OL,18,FWork continues to demolish the Anglia
OL,19,FSquare buildings in the city, with two
OL,20,Fof the largest, Sovereign House and
OL,21,FGildengate House, next on the list.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
