OL,3,GNEWSADerelict sites warning after
OL,4,Atrespasser posts images
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Norwich City Council
OL,7,Fsaid: "We have repeatedly warned of the
OL,8,Fobvious and inherent dangers of
OL,9,Ftrespassing on a live demolition site."
